#X obj 652 11 fx.greyhole~;
#X obj 205 78 cnv 1 560 120 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -257983 -1 0;
#X text 215 83 A complex echo-like effect \, inspired by the classic
Eventide effect of a similar name. The effect consists of a diffuser
(like a mini-reverb \, structurally similar to the one used in JPverb)
connected in a feedback system with a long \, modulated delay-line.
Excels at producing spacey washes of sound.;
#X text 215 168 Developed as part of the DEIND project.;
#X msg 50 246 1000 1000 0 \, 300 300 1000 \, 3000 500 1300 \, 0 100 1400;
#X obj 50 275 vline~;
#X obj 50 304 osc.saw~;
#X obj 50 333 fx.greyhole~;
#X obj 213 333 ui.hsl;
#X obj 50 376 *~;
#X obj 126 376 *~;
#X obj 50 419 dac~;
